The most important design principle

Do not try to show the whole graph all at once.

The cosmos should operate by levels of reveal:

Default

Only major streams + key concepts + major phase access points

Stream focus

Show one stream’s main nodes

Node focus

Show local neighborhood

AI answer focus

Show just the path relevant to the answer

This prevents visual slop.

